<section>

<h1>
About Hearts Turn Healing & Recovery
</h1>

<p>
Every person's path to recovery is different, and every person deserves
treatment aimed at long-term success, not just short-term stabilization.
Too many people fall through the cracks of treatment that isn't built around
them, and recovery often fails when it only addresses the surface.
</p>

<p>
That is why Hearts Turn Healing & Recovery pairs evidence-based clinical care
with a whole-person approach, integrating each client's community, and their
personal or spiritual beliefs, into their treatment.
</p>

</section>


